"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:04:30-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:04:30","sender":"DV","content":"Quanto as crianças, tiziano esta fora, e stella tanto eu quanto minha mae conversamos com ela","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10163,"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:04:34-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:04:34","sender":"DV","content":"Ela ja entendeu","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10164,"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:05:10-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:05:10","sender":"DV","content":"Ela me disse que ja sabia e sentia. Com a stella ta tudo bem","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10165,"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:06:19-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:06:19","sender":"DV","content":"Amor , confia em mim","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10166,"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:06:24-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:06:24","sender":"DV","content":"Esse negocio","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10167,"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:06:44-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:06:44","sender":"DV","content":"Vai se resolver de vez em muito breve","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10168,"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:06:51-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:06:51","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"Eu te amo mais do que tudo nesse mundo e confio em você. Só tenho medo de te perder","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10169,"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:07:13-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:07:13","sender":"DV","content":"Amor, nosso amor é pra sempre, é eterno","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10170,"timestamp":"2024-07-01T07:07:19-03:00","date":"2024-07-01","time":"07:07:19","sender":"DV","content":"Nao existe a possibilidade","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":10171,"t